# A patch applied on the Linux/macOS build host must not carry CRLF: git apply
# rejects the context. Keep the series and the patches LF in the index and in
# every checkout, including the Windows one.
*.patch text eol=lf
*.dts text eol=lf
*.dtsi text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.toml text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
* text=auto eol=lf
